# Copy .env.example to .env in the same folder, then paste one key per line
# after the equals sign.
#
#     cp -n .env.example .env
#
# .gitignore excludes .env, so no key reaches the repository, the Dataverse
# deposit or the shell history file. Every command in the repository reads .env
# when the command starts, so a key is typed once and works in every terminal.
# A line with no value after the equals sign is ignored, and a variable already
# set in the shell wins over the line in .env.
#
# OPENROUTER_API_KEY is issued at openrouter.ai under Keys, then Create key, and
# serves all six confirmatory models. A credit limit set when the key is created
# stops the key from spending past the limit.
#
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY is issued at console.anthropic.com under API keys, and is
# needed only to send the Stage A pilot calls to Claude Haiku 4.5 again.
#
# AIMSA_DIR is not a key. AIMSA_DIR names the folder holding the files of the
# completed AI Moral Status Audit, as Step 2.3 of README.md describes. With no
# value, the harness looks for a folder named "18. Yale DECS 2026" beside the
# repository folder.

OPENROUTER_API_KEY=
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
AIMSA_DIR=
